t run we elected to keep it to our "OG" with no flavor packs.  But we want to hear from you on what flavors you want to see next!  Email us at <a href="mailto:hey@boostcous.com">hey@boostcous.com</a> to share what you'd like to see!</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="a1ec5162-4392-4409-b97c-e4c0ea448d34" class="r-67ph7s" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="6cbaa316-f052-42cd-b5e0-9357e063a855" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R16rj2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-yo6hra"><div data-rid="71e2c62f-c112-4145-9018-88301a4148f0" class="r-1n2z4un alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><strong>What is the size of the pearls?</strong></p></span></div><div data-rid="e93a4833-4885-4364-a764-aa075039d962" class="r-ot2muv" aria-hidden="true"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:auto;max-height:100%" class="r-1q8ucxh" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M1.646 4.646a.5.5 0 0 1 .708 0L8 10.293l5.646-5.647a.5.5 0 0 1 .708.708l-6 6a.5.5 0 0 1-.708 0l-6-6a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.708"></path></svg></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R16rj2:"><div data-rid="906d019f-c5c0-4a72-9d6f-3bdb43577b11" class="r-1u8n3tj"><div data-rid="75b47fa9-7719-4223-a520-47efea9c8eb8" class="r-1b7n405 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Boostcous is medium sized so its slightly smaller than traditional pearl (Israeli) couscous and slightly larger than traditional Moroccan couscous. <br><br>It resembles more of the taste of pearl style while maintaining the benefit of the quick cook time of Moroccan style.  Best of both worlds!</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="4aca938d-261e-40b0-8859-79e2720546c6" class="r-tmkl94" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="dc620bd3-cb67-41f6-a85f-f7c873a6d71a" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R1mrj2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-10d3wog"><div data-rid="10a32941-6488-4a63-af71-6c0fa23fb299" class="r-18twu3g alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><h5><strong>What's inside each order? What am I getting?</strong></h5></span></div><div data-rid="5a475f0d-fcd6-4f37-8233-3d9312d06b95" class="r-1kephi9" aria-hidden="true"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:auto;max-height:100%" class="r-i2khnv" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M1.646 4.646a.5.5 0 0 1 .708 0L8 10.293l5.646-5.647a.5.5 0 0 1 .708.708l-6 6a.5.5 0 0 1-.708 0l-6-6a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.708"></path></svg></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R1mrj2:"><div data-rid="cbde6270-8021-4ce7-b6dc-2291f03710c0" class="r-s4f81q"><div data-rid="319c37ac-e499-4474-ba5e-b2282a75aabc" class="r-13mzw9k alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Each order comes with a 6-pack of Boostcous <br><br>Each box of Boostcous contains 225G of couscous and is enough for 3 servings.  Each serving is 75g</p><p><br></p><p>So each 6 pack should feed 2 people for 6 meals or 1 person for 12 meals. Boostcous is just as tasty reheated so you can make a bunch for meal prepping if thats your jam</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="03cb18c2-7144-42b6-814c-38e5620d752e" class="r-iqkagd" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="c6d7c045-a9ec-4d65-8973-a193d5045633" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R26rj2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-11baygr"><div data-rid="1a68e9aa-4544-496d-9aa5-57a9218e8a00" class="r-eih2kh alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><strong>When will my Boostcous arrive?</strong></p></span></div><div data-rid="eef30545-4129-46fb-ba61-4f9cc37c3ddf" class="r-qcralk" aria-hidden="true"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:auto;max-height:100%" class="r-ojs4iu" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M1.646 4.646a.5.5 0 0 1 .708 0L8 10.293l5.646-5.647a.5.5 0 0 1 .708.708l-6 6a.5.5 0 0 1-.708 0l-6-6a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.708"></path></svg></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R26rj2:"><div data-rid="9634d5f0-afc1-4420-8054-2bd15fb63ae9" class="r-z8d7z6"><div data-rid="bfaa6472-304b-4303-a9ed-cd06f30bbd85" class="r-1gby2rj alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>We're fast! Orders typically ship within 24 hours and on average arrive 2 days later. You could be making your first batch of Boostcous just 3 days from now.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="2f63ea16-32dc-41f6-aa3d-4c51ec1612cc" class="r-tg8z5l" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="3a8c2961-75cb-421d-9df2-cb48827fbb3e" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R2mrj2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1yyy8yp"><div data-rid="5124f783-b78c-4b27-ae81-72c183251cdb" class="r-1pcs7rp alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><strong>Is Boostcous the same as Boost Cous?</strong></p></span></div><div data-rid="a2a2c9b9-3505-4688-9693-4d5fb6f37ed5" class="r-pw593c" aria-hidden="true"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:auto;max-height:100%" class="r-1x0q97w" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M1.646 4.646a.5.5 0 0 1 .708 0L8 10.293l5.646-5.647a.5.5 0 0 1 .708.708l-6 6a.5.5 0 0 1-.708 0l-6-6a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.708"></path></svg></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R2mrj2:"><div data-rid="71a14029-3f52-4930-93ec-3a59c7afa242" cl